    "_postman_id": "10a65e8b-f08f-46cd-8eb9-dcfda218bfe1",
    "name": "Library API - Week 3",
    "description": "# Library API - Week 3 Day 4\n\nThis collection tests the full CRUD operations for the Books resource  \nusing ASP.NET Core, Entity Framework Core, and SQL Server.\n\n## Base URL\n\n`{{baseUrl}}`\n\n## Resource\n\n`/api/v1/books`\n\n## Endpoints\n\n- `GET /api/v1/books` - Get all books.\n    \n- `GET /api/v1/books/{id}` - Get one book by ID.\n    \n- `POST /api/v1/books` - Create a new book.\n    \n- `PUT /api/v1/books/{id}` - Update an existing book.\n    \n- `DELETE /api/v1/books/{id}` - Delete a book.\n    \n\n## Status Codes Tested\n\n- `200 OK`\n    \n- `201 Created`\n    \n- `204 No Content`\n    \n- `400 Bad Request`\n    \n- `404 Not Found`\n    \n\nThe collection includes both successful requests and deliberate  \nerror cases for every endpoint.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "57019799",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/57019799-10a65e8b-f08f-46cd-8eb9-dcfda218bfe1?source=collection_link"
  },
